SPECIAL

MIS Linux, "Make it so. Linux", is dedicated to the memory of:

  Sir Patrick Stewart    Captain Jean-Luc Picard     28 October 2026
  Walter Koenig          Ensign Pavel Chekov         25 October 2026

who left us within three days of each other in October 2026, while
version 0.4 was being built. "Make it so." was Picard's order, and it
is this distribution's name.

And in memory of the Star Trek crew who went before them:

  Nichelle Nichols            Lieutenant Nyota Uhura            30 July 2022
  René Auberjonois            Constable Odo                     8 December 2019
  Anton Yelchin               Pavel Chekov (2009-2016 films)    19 June 2016
  Grace Lee Whitney           Yeoman Janice Rand                1 May 2015
  Leonard Nimoy               Mr. Spock                         27 February 2015
  Majel Barrett-Roddenberry   Nurse Christine Chapel, Number    18 December 2008
                              One, Lwaxana Troi, and the voice
                              of the Enterprise computer
  James Doohan                Montgomery "Scotty" Scott         20 July 2005
  DeForest Kelley             Dr. Leonard "Bones" McCoy         11 June 1999

And of Gene Roddenberry (24 October 1991), who created Star Trek.

Thank you for showing us a future worth building.

Live long and prosper.
